DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Yoga For Better You @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260407T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260407T193000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;INTERVAL=1;BYDAY=TU;UNTIL=20261229T235959Z
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Recreation & Fitness
DESCRIPTION:Windsong Residents! Join Burn Fat\, Build Strength Yoga by Yoga
  For Better You (YFBY).\nPerfect for residents looking to lose weight\, im
 prove metabolic and hormonal health\, and build strength.\nThese 60-minute
  sessions combine yoga\, functional training\, and strength-building movem
 ents to help boost metabolism\, support sustainable weight loss\, build st
 rength\, improve sleep\, enhance posture\, increase energy levels\, and re
 duce stress.\nClasses are suitable for all levels — whether you are star
 ting your fitness journey or looking to lose weight\, build strength\, and
  improve overall metabolic and hormonal health.\nContact Certified Weight 
 Loss Coach & Yoga Alliance Certified Yoga Instructor\, Rashmi Venkat\, at 
 yogaforbetteryou@gmail.com for more details.
END:VEVENT
