 wo flights of games\, depending on the format used. At times\, the format 
 is King of the Court\, and other times it’s a round robin.\nThe free Swi
 sh app is used to automate the lineups and scoring. This league is ideal f
 or players at the advanced beginner level and beyond. A private GroupMe gr
 oup is utilized for meet-ups and other communications. See you on the cour
 ts!
