BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:9fb11234b2cd31b0571951148c9b5a7089104f8f@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Lunar New Year @ THE COMMONS
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260213T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260213T200000
LOCATION:THE COMMONS
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:We’re looking forward to celebrating the Lunar New Year with 
 you this Friday\, February 13\, from 6:00 to 8:30 PM as we welcome the Yea
 r of the Horse with an evening full of energy\, light\, and community spir
 it!\nDue to capacity limitations at THE LAGOON\, the event has been reloca
 ted to THE COMMONS. All programming and festivities will proceed as planne
 d\, just in our new location. Please note: The parking lot at THE COMMONS 
 will be closed off beginning at 4:30 PM to accommodate event setup and ens
 ure a safe experience for all attendees.\nOur festive celebration includes
  a live DJ\, glowing firepits\, and a photo booth to capture the moment. F
 or those who purchased a floating lantern\, our lantern release will take 
 place at 7:00 PM at THE COMMONS Upper Pools. Then at 7:30 PM\, we’ll gat
 her for a special highlight of the evening: our lion dance show!\nWe appre
 ciate your flexibility and understanding as we ensure a safe\, enjoyable e
 xperience for everyone. We can’t wait to celebrate with you!\nRSVP : htt
 ps://secure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?filter=c2VhcmNoPTQwO
 DY1MDc=
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
