DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260220T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260220T200000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of music and fun! Karaoke Night is happen
 ing on Friday\, February 20\, from 6 PM to 8 PM at THE BRIDGE. This event 
 is designed for an adult crowd—whether you’re ready to take the mic or
  just want to enjoy the show\, it’s the perfect way to unwind at the end
  of the week.\nEntry is just $5 per person\, and your ticket includes ligh
 t refreshments\, snacks\, and adult beverages (while supplies last). After
  checkout\, you’ll receive a downloadable ticket—please bring it on yo
 ur mobile device or as a printed copy for entry.\nRegistration closes the 
 day before the event at 10:00 AM. Capacity is limited\, so register early 
 and secure your spot. We can’t wait to hear you shine on stage!\nRSVP : 
 https://secure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?filter=c2VhcmNoPT
 QwOTE5NTg=
