BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fe3961691ecc37d1e8af3be70cf24bccd533fba8@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Plant & Sip @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260227T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260227T203000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for spring with a hands‑on terrarium‑making works
 hop on Friday\, February 27\, at 6:30 PM at THE BRIDGE designed to spark c
 reativity and bring fresh\, seasonal charm into your home. Hosted by Plant
  & Sip\, residents will build their own spring‑inspired succulent terrar
 ium with guidance from an experienced instructor who will walk participant
 s through each step in a relaxed\, creative environment. You’ll also hav
 e the chance to personalize your terrarium with decorative elements that r
 eflect your own style.\nAll materials—including plants\, containers\, to
 ols\, and décor—will be provided. Light snacks and beverages will be av
 ailable\, and the event is BYOB for those who would like to enjoy a drink 
 while they create. The workshop typically lasts 1.5 to 2 hours and offers 
 a fun\, social way to unwind\, learn something new\, and welcome the new s
 eason.\nPlease note : Containers\, plants\, and décor may vary slightly b
 ased on availability\, ensuring each terrarium is uniquely your own.\nRSVP
  : https://www.plantandsip.com/product/02-27-26-6-30-p-m-Spring-Succulent-
 Terrarium-Workshop-***PRIVATE-EVENT-FOR-THE-WINDSONG-RANCH-COMMUNITY-RESID
 ENTS***
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2c08970d04f09b2193f2f68cb67293346dc0f85d@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Dallas Mavericks Game @ American Airlines Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260301T171500
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260301T220000
LOCATION:American Airlines Center
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exciting off‑site trip to the American Airline
 s Center as the Dallas Mavericks take on the Oklahoma City Thunder! This s
 pecial outing is open to registered residents and includes both your game 
 ticket and round‑trip transportation.\nThe game takes place on Sunday\, 
 March 1 \, with a 7:00 PM tipoff . The bus will depart promptly at 5:15 PM
  from THE COMMONS and will return immediately after the game. The cost is 
 $60 per person\, and registration is required. Your fee covers game entry 
 and transportation\, with tickets assigned within Sections 307 and 308. Se
 ating is first‑come\, first‑served\, beginning with the lowest rows cl
 osest to center court.\nTo ensure your group is seated together\, all tick
 ets must be purchased in a single transaction\; separate registrations may
  result in your group being split during seat assignment. Please note that
  tickets are non‑refundable once allocated to your registration. Once pa
 yment is received\, your tickets will be transferred to the email on file 
 via Ticketmaster before the event. Your phone will serve as your ticket an
 d must be presented at check‑in. Tickets are required to board the bus.\
 nRegistration closes the day before the event at 10:00 AM. Get ready for a
  fun night of basketball\, community\, and Mavericks spirit—we hope to s
 ee you there!\nRSVP : https://secure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/cat
 alog?filter=c2VhcmNoPTQwOTg5MDQ=
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
