DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Golf Tournament @ Dallas Cowboys Golf Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260307T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260307T184500
LOCATION:Dallas Cowboys Golf Club
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Grab your clubs and join us for a hole-in-one kind of day at th
 e Dallas Cowboys Golf Club on Saturday\, March 7 ! We're kicking things of
 f with an 8:00 AM shotgun start \, followed by 18 holes of championship go
 lf with your own cart.\nEnjoy a delicious breakfast and lunch as part of y
 our experience. Plus\, show off your skills for a chance to win fantastic 
 prizes. Including awards for Best Score (Foursome)\, Longest Putt\, Longes
 t Drive\, and Closest to the Star.\nThe cost is $100 per person\, and spac
 e is limited to 52 participants\, so don't wait! Registration closes the d
 ay before the event at 10:00 AM. Sign up today and secure your spot for th
 is exciting day!\nRSVP : https://secure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/
 catalog?filter=c2VhcmNoPTQwOTg4MTY=
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:468d47057d80954f0e853ab00af65c48f789b15f@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Blood Drive @ THE COMMONS
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260328T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260328T160000
LOCATION:THE COMMONS
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Give the gift of life right here in the community. Carter Blood
 Care will be onsite at THE COMMONS on Saturday\, March 28\, from 10:30 AM 
 to 4:00 PM with their mobile donation bus. All donors will receive a Quilt
 ed Tote Bag as a thank‑you\, while supplies last!\nScheduling an appoint
 ment is encouraged to help keep the process quick and smooth. Don't forget
 \, a photo ID is required to donate.\nBlood donations make a meaningful im
 pact for neighbors across North Texas\, and this is a great opportunity to
  support patients like Brenda from Dallas\, whose life was saved thanks to
  local donors. Thank you for your contribution to support patients in the 
 community!\nRegister Here : https://www.greatpartners.org/donor/schedules/
 drive_schedule/171385
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:80c0881550ff7bf36c8df7168d4f626ab7c19f2e@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Freebirds @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260226T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260226T210000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Free Birds is a social club for couples and singles living in W
 indsong Ranch who are empty nesters or almost empty nesters who want to ha
 ng out with individuals who are like-minded\, pursue shared interests\, an
 d are looking to build lasting relationships. The group typically meets mo
 nthly\, on a Thursday night\, for a variety of themed events\, which inclu
 de food\, drinks\, and games. Most events are held within the Windsong Ran
 ch Community\, with a few events held outside the community at nearby loca
