 on Friday\, June 19\, from 6 to 8 PM. This inspiring event is an opportuni
 ty to honor history\, embrace culture\, and connect with neighbors in a wa
 rm and welcoming atmosphere.\nEnjoy a relaxed evening filled with deliciou
 s food\, lively music\, and exciting raffles\, along with thoughtful momen
 ts of reflection featuring poetry and a brief look at the history and sign
 ificance of Juneteenth. It’s a meaningful way to come together\, celebra
 te heritage\, and share in an evening centered on community and connection
 .\nThis is a ticketed event\, and a downloadable ticket will be provided a
