SUMMARY:Star-Spangled Bash @ THE COMMONS Event Lawn
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260620T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260620T213000
LOCATION:THE COMMONS Event Lawn
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for one of the most anticipated celebrations of the yea
 r as we come together to honor America’s 250th birthday in true red\, wh
 ite\, and blue style! On Saturday\, June 20 \, our Star-Spangled Bash prom
 ises a full day of patriotic pride\, community spirit\, and unforgettable 
 fun.\nThe celebration begins with our beloved annual Golf Cart Parade ! Li
 ne-up starts at 3:30 PM at THE LAGOON\, with the parade rolling out at 4:3
 0 PM . Deck out your cart in festive décor\, gather your crew\, and show 
 off your American spirit as we kick off the evening with this favorite com
 munity tradition.\nThen\, head to THE COMMONS Event Lawn from 5:30 to 9:30
  PM where the celebration continues with live music\, lively vendor booths
 \, interactive games\, and activities for all ages. Food trucks will be se
 rving up delicious favorites all evening long\, making it easy to relax\, 
 enjoy\, and soak in the festive atmosphere.\nAs the night reaches its peak
 \, join friends and neighbors for a spectacular fireworks finale at 9:30 P
 M \, lighting up the sky in a dazzling tribute to 250 years of American hi
 story\, freedom\, and unity.\nThis event is free to attend\, but registrat
 ion is required on Civic Rec and will close Friday\, June 19 at 10:00 AM. 
 Residents should wear their Windsong access card for entry\; those without
  a card may be asked to present a valid photo ID.\nA special thank you to 
 Cook’s Children for serving as our signature sponsor for this incredible
  evening. Let’s come together to celebrate this historic milestone in a 
 big way—we can’t wait to see you there!\nRSVP : https://secure.rec1.co
 m/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?filter=c2VhcmNoPTQzNTIwOTg=
END:VEVENT
