LOCATION:THE LAGOON
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Escape to the islands without leaving the neighborhood at our S
 ummer Luau! Join us on Saturday\, August 1\, from 6 PM to 9 PM at THE LAGO
 ON for an unforgettable evening filled with tropical entertainment\, delic
 ious food\, and fun for all ages. Grab your favorite Hawaiian shirt and ge
 t ready to experience the spirit of aloha!\nEnjoy live Polynesian dancers\
 , thrilling fire performers\, and a special visit from Moana. Dance the ni
 ght away with our live DJ\, cool off on exciting water slides\, or test yo
 ur skills on the coconut tree climbing wall. Create island-inspired crafts
 \, sample a traditional pig roast\, and treat yourself to delicious eats f
 rom a variety of food trucks. Be sure to stop by our Tiki Bar\, where you'
 ll find refreshing specialty mocktails perfect for sipping all evening lon
 g.\nThis event requires an RSVP through CivicRec due to safety and capacit
 y limitations. Please have your CivicRec tickets ready to be scanned at th
