DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Yoga For Better You @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260405T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260405T100000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;INTERVAL=1;BYDAY=SU;UNTIL=20261227T235959Z
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Recreation & Fitness
DESCRIPTION:Windsong Residents! Sign up your kids for Smart & Strong Kids Y
 oga by Yoga For Better You (YFBY) — a fun and enriching yoga program cre
 ated just for them.\nPerfect for parents looking to help their children im
 prove focus\, confidence\, emotional balance\, breathing awareness and hea
 lthy habits in today’s screen-heavy world.\nThrough fun yoga poses\, bre
 athing techniques\, mindfulness\, and creative storytelling\, children dev
 elop better concentration\, stronger memory for studies\, life values\, se
 lf-awareness\, & resilience while building focus\, calmness\, and confiden
 ce.\nThese sessions also include simple breathing practices to improve lun
 g capacity & support kids who experience seasonal allergies\, while helpin
 g them build better breathing habits and inner strength to navigate school
 \, friendships\, and everyday challenges with confidence.\nContact Yoga Al
 liance Certified Kids Yoga Instructor\, Rashmi Venkat\, at yogaforbetteryo
 u@gmail.com for more details.
END:VEVENT
