BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a3f8456dc8b60f2b9553f7a8c9abc67bb656d2d1@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Golf Cart Health Check with SoCar @ THE LAGOON
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260328T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260328T130000
LOCATION:THE LAGOON
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Keep your golf cart running smoothly with a FREE Golf Cart Heal
 th Check on Saturday\, March 28\, from 11 AM to 1 PM at THE LAGOON\, broug
 ht to you by SoCar! Their expert service team will be on‑site to provide
  a complimentary inspection and help ensure your cart is safe\, reliable\,
  and ready for the season.\nDuring the check‑up\, technicians will revie
 w key areas including battery performance\, tire health\, safety features\
 , and steering/suspension components—giving you peace of mind without th
 e pressure of sales or service commitments. It’s a quick and convenient 
 way to care for one of your favorite modes of transportation.\nThis family
 ‑owned team is dedicated to helping residents enjoy the lifestyle they l
 ove with quality\, trustworthy service. As a special bonus\, Windsong resi
 dents will receive $500 off any new golf cart purchase through April 30\, 
 2026. Stop by\, roll up\, and let the experts take care of the rest!
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
