DESCRIPTION:Join us for our community Health & Wellness Expo on Friday\, Ap
 ril 24\, from 11 AM to 1 PM at THE BRIDGE—a relaxed and informative even
 t focused on supporting healthy living for residents of all ages! This exp
 o is perfect for anyone interested in learning more about wellness\, nutri
 tion\, and simple ways to build healthier habits into everyday life.\nThro
 ughout the event\, residents can explore at their own pace\, participate i
 n optional activity sessions\, and engage with helpful resources designed 
 to encourage confidence and well‑being. Whether you’re looking to gain
  new insights or simply enjoy a wellness‑focused morning\, there’s som
 ething for everyone.\nResidents can look forward to:\nInformative discussi
 ons on nutrition and general wellness\nOptional workout and movement sessi
 ons\nInteractive demonstrations from health professionals\nComplimentary r
 efreshments and healthy snacks (while supplies last)\nWe are proud to part
 ner with Texas Health\, who will be on-site providing expert guidance\, de
 monstrations\, and valuable information throughout the event.\nRSVP : http
 s://secure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?filter=c2VhcmNoPTQyMT
 k2ODc=
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
