DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260425T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260425T190000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Shake things up and join us for a Mixology Class hosted by The 
 Abstract Mixologist\, Caroline Korshak\, on Saturday\, April 25\, from 6 t
 o 7:30 PM at THE BRIDGE.! This session will explore the history of whiskey
  cocktails\, with guests learning to craft four featured drinks while enjo
 ying a fun\, relaxed evening with neighbors.\nThe cost is $15 per person\,
  with registration available through Civic Rec. Registration closes at 10:
 00 AM the day before the event\, and space is limited\, so be sure to sign
  up early!\nRSVP : https://secure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalo
 g?filter=c2VhcmNoPTQyNjMzMTU=
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
