DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260515T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260515T200000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a relaxed and social bingo night designed especiall
 y for adults and seniors on Friday\, May 15\, from 6 to 8 PM at THE BRIDGE
 . This evening offers the perfect opportunity to connect with neighbors\, 
 enjoy great company\, and unwind—for just $7 per person!\nAdult beverage
 s and light snacks will be provided while supplies last\, and guests are w
 elcome to bring their own food and drinks to keep the party going. Partici
 pants will enjoy several rounds of classic bingo\, with fun prizes up for 
 grabs throughout the night.\nRegistration is closes the day before the eve
 nt at 10:00 AM\, and space is limited. This is a ticketed event\, and a do
 wnloadable ticket will be provided after checkout. Please bring your ticke
 t—either on your mobile device or as a printed copy—as it will be scan
 ned at the door for entry. Doors will open at 5:45 PM. We hope to see you 
 there!\nRSVP : https://secure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?fi
 lter=c2VhcmNoPTQyNTkzODg=
