 riday\, May 8\, from 10 to 11 AM at THE BRIDGE\, hosted by Club Pilates Wi
 ndsong! This complimentary\, full‑body workout focuses on strengthening\
 , lengthening\, and restoring your body—leaving you feeling refreshed\, 
 balanced\, and ready to enjoy the weekend ahead.\nThe class is designed wi
 th an adult audience in mind and is perfect for all experience levels. Fol
 lowing the workout\, the Club Pilates team will remain on site until 1 PM 
 to answer questions and help interested participants book a free reformer 
 session.\nPlease remember to bring your own mat\, water for hydration\, an
 d a towel (optional). Registration closes the day before the event at 10:0
 0 AM. We hope you’ll join us for this fun and revitalizing fitness exper
