DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:CPR & First Aid Class @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260516T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260516T110000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, May 16 at 10 AM at THE BRIDGE for a CPR &
  First Aid class\, hosted by Cardinal CPR! This interactive\, hands‑on c
 lass is a great way to learn practical\, life‑saving skills that can hel
 p you feel more confident and prepared in everyday situations. Whether you
 ’re looking to refresh your knowledge or learn something new\, this clas
 s is a smart and empowering way to spend your morning.\nThe cost to attend
  is $40 per person. For those who would like to receive a two‑year certi
 fication through the Health & Safety Institute\, an additional $15 will ap
 ply.\nTo register and submit payment\, please reach out to Jonathan Tapper
  at cardinalcpr@outlook.com . We hope to see you there!
END:VEVENT
