DESCRIPTION:Join instructor Charlene Boese for a fun and effective summer w
 orkout with water aerobics classes\, featuring a combination of high and l
 ow-impact exercises designed to strengthen your core and improve overall m
 uscle tone.\nAdditionally\, explore the benefits of Pilates\, a unique for
 m of exercise that targets specific muscle groups using only your body wei
 ght—no equipment or machines required. Pilates focuses on enhancing core
  strength\, balance\, and flexibility\, offering a great complement to you
 r fitness routine with minimal risk of injury.\nInterested in joining? For
  more information\, contact Charlene Boese at bodybyboese67@gmail.com .
END:VEVENT
