UID:33517814275ead16801313bfeb3cd44ba5363af3@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:British Swim School @ THE COMMONS Pools
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260505T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260505T200000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;INTERVAL=1;BYDAY=TU;UNTIL=20260922T235959Z
LOCATION:THE COMMONS Pools
CATEGORIES:Recreation & Fitness
DESCRIPTION:British Swim School is returning to Windsong Ranch for the swim
  season! Convenient lessons are offered at THE COMMONS pool on Tuesday and
  Thursday evenings\, Wednesday mornings\, and Saturdays.\nWith a survival-
 first approach\, British Swim School helps swimmers of all ages build wate
 r safety skills\, confidence\, and strong swimming techniques. Classes are
  available for infants\, children\, and adults\, with small class sizes an
 d expert-trained instructors providing a fun and supportive learning envir
 onment. Programs range from beginner water acclimation to advanced stroke 
 development.\nFor more information or to register\, call (940) 230-2578 . 
 We look forward to another season of safety\, confidence\, and fun in the 
 water!
END:VEVENT
