BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20becbb7ead4427e1fac072714f621efcfe32445@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Card Club @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260701T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260701T210000
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=1;BYSETPOS=1;BYDAY=WE;UNTIL=20261230T235959Z
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to connect with neighbors and enjoy an ev
 ening of friendly competition? Join the Windsong Ranch Card Club \, where 
 residents gather regularly to play card games\, socialize\, and build comm
 unity. Whether you're an experienced card player or just learning the rope
 s\, all skill levels are welcome.\nBring your favorite beverage\, enjoy gr
 eat conversation\, and spend time with fellow residents in a relaxed and w
 elcoming atmosphere. Decks of cards are provided \, and guests are encoura
 ged to bring a snack to share. Come for the games\, stay for the camarader
 ie\, and make new friends along the way!\nInterested in joining? For more 
 information\, please contact Karen O’Brien at karenoo@icloud.com .
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4c8b5ba4cbb66fb765adf6ae79d3e1b560e7eda0@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Free Birds @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260730T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260730T210000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Free Birds is a social club for couples and singles living in W
 indsong Ranch who are empty nesters or almost empty nesters who want to ha
 ng out with individuals who are like-minded\, pursue shared interests\, an
 d are looking to build lasting relationships. The group typically meets mo
 nthly \, on a Thursday night \, for a variety of themed events \, which in
 clude food\, drinks\, and games. Most events are held within the Windsong 
 Ranch Community\, with a few events held outside the community at nearby l
 ocations.\nInterested in joining? For more information\, contact the Free 
 birds at wsr.freebirds@gmail.com or visit their Facebook page at Windsong 
 Free birds .
END:VEVENT
