LOCATION:THE LAGOON
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Take a break and enjoy Lunch at THE LAGOON on Saturday\, Septem
 ber 12\, from 12 PM to 3 PM at THE LAGOON. JK Delicieux and Jeremiah's Ita
 lian Ice will be onsite with delicious lunch and dessert options available
  for purchase. Whether you're spending the day by the water or simply stop
 ping by for a bite to eat\, it's the perfect way to enjoy great food\, swe
 et treats\, and time with neighbors!\nJoin us again on Saturday\, Septembe
 r 19\, from 12 PM to 3 PM at THE LAGOON more delicious treats featuring Sm
 oken SB BBQ and Jeremiah's Italian Ice!\nEnjoy delicious eats\, sweet trea
 ts\, and good company while taking in one of the community's favorite gath
 ering spots. We hope to see you there!
END:VEVENT
