 f the Prosper Police Department!\nStop by THE BRIDGE on Wednesday\, Octobe
 r 21\, from 10:00 to 11:30 AM to enjoy coffee and refreshments while getti
 ng to know the officers who serve our community. This informal gathering i
 s a great opportunity to ask questions\, learn more about public safety in
  Windsong Ranch\, and connect with our local law enforcement team.\nThe Pr
 osper Police Department will also be available to answer questions about e
 -bikes\, scooters\, and golf carts. Please register by 10:00 AM on Monday\
 , October 19. Registration is required to help us plan appropriately for r
 efreshments and seating. This is a ticketed event\, and a downloadable tic
 ket will be provided after checkout. Please bring your ticket—either on 
