BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ae2c61d64ee592a2410294c5470fd5c17eecafd0@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Robotics Camp @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261012T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261012T130000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Windsong Ranch residents\, RoboThink is hosting a special 2-day
  STEAM Lab Camp at THE BRIDGE on Monday\, October 12\, and Tuesday\, Octob
 er 13\, from 10 AM to 1 PM each day. This is robotics reimagined — where
  art and engineering converge to spark real creativity. Campers build work
 ing machines like spirograph art bots and kinetic sculptures while explori
 ng famous artists and movements\, from Mondrian’s geometry to Banksy’s
  street art.\nAlong the way\, they’ll pick up real engineering skills 
 — gear ratios\, DC motors\, mechanical design — and problem-solving\, 
 spatial reasoning\, and creativity\, all through hands-on building. No exp
 erience necessary\, and RoboThink provides every material. Open to ages 6
 –12. $129 per camper. Spots are limited to Windsong Ranch residents — 
 register today!\nQuestions? Contact RoboThink at (469) 712-7130 \, collint
 x@myrobothink.com \, or visit collintx.myrobothink.com for additional info
 rmation.
END:VEVENT
