DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261006T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261006T193000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for National Night Out on Tuesday\, October 6\, from 5:
 30 to 7:30 PM as we come together to celebrate community\, build connectio
 ns\, and show our support for the local heroes who help keep us safe!\nNat
 ional Night Out is a nationwide community-building event that brings resid
 ents and local law enforcement together to strengthen relationships\, prom
 ote neighborhood safety\, and create a stronger sense of community.\nMeet 
 members of the Prosper Police Department and Prosper Fire Department\, get
  an up-close look at their vehicles\, and enjoy special tours while famili
 es connect with the heroes who serve our community.\nThe little ones can a
 lso meet some of their other favorite heroes\, including Spider-Man and Ch
 ase from PAW Patrol! Plus\, enjoy food trucks serving up delicious bites a
 nd themed inflatables for the kids to enjoy until sunset!\nBring the whole
  family\, grab some food\, meet your local heroes\, and enjoy an evening o
 f fun\, connection\, and community spirit.\nRSVP : https://secure.rec1.com
 /TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?filter=c2VhcmNoPTQ1MDc5MTE=
