SUMMARY:Activate Game Night @ Activate Games in Plano
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261012T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261012T200000
LOCATION:Activate Games in Plano
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an action-packed evening at Activate Games in Pla
 no! This unique interactive gaming experience combines physical activity\,
  problem-solving\, teamwork\, and friendly competition through a series of
  immersive\, high-tech challenge rooms.\nWork together to complete excitin
 g missions\, test your reflexes\, tackle mental puzzles\, and race against
  the clock as you progress through a variety of games designed for all ski
 ll levels. Whether you're looking to challenge yourself\, compete with fri
 ends\, or simply try something new\, there's something for everyone.\nJoin
  us on Monday\, October 12\, from 7 PM to 8 PM at Activate Games Plano\, l
 ocated at 5013 W Plano Pkwy\, Plano\, TX 75093. Please plan to meet us at 
 the venue and arrive by 6:45 PM to allow time for group check-in. The cost
  to attend is $20 per person.\nTo keep your energy up between rounds\, we'
 ll be providing a variety of Jimmy John's sandwiches\, chips\, drinks\, an
 d additional snacks throughout the evening.\nA completed waiver is require
 d for each person attending. To help avoid delays during check-in\, please
  complete your waiver after registering using the link provided below.\nDo
 n't miss this opportunity to experience one of the area's most exciting in
 teractive attractions while connecting with fellow Windsong Ranch resident
 s. Space is limited to the first 50 residents\, so be sure to register ear
 ly!\nRSVP : https://secure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?filte
 r=c2VhcmNoPTQ1MDUyNzA=
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:44601f77af1e52fa6afa31cce2955f2535a2bd0f@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Cowboys Watch Party @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261026T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261026T220000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Football season is here! Join us on Monday\, October 26\, begin
 ning at 7:15 PM \, for a prime-time matchup as the Dallas Cowboys take on 
 the Philadelphia Eagles at THE BRIDGE. Whether you prefer watching from in
 side the amenity center or under the stars on our giant outdoor projection
  screen\, this is the perfect opportunity to enjoy a fun evening of footba
 ll and community.\nResidents ages 21 and older can enjoy complimentary bee
 r while supplies last\, and food trucks will be on-site with a variety of 
 game-day favorites available for purchase.\nWe're also excited to welcome 
 a hot dog food truck to the event! The first 50 residents will receive a c
 omplimentary hot dog combo (plain hot dog only) while supplies last. Limit
  one free combo per person and available on a first-come\, first-served ba
 sis. Additional menu items will be available for purchase at the resident'
 s discretion.\nYou're also welcome to bring your own food and beverages to
  enjoy throughout the game. Bring a lawn chair or blanket for outdoor view
 ing\, or arrive early to claim a first-come\, first-served seat inside and
  catch the action on one of three TVs.\nBe sure to show off your team spir
 it during our Windsong Fanatics Face-Off at halftime! From jerseys and the
 med outfits to over-the-top game-day gear\, we'll be recognizing the most 
 spirited NFL fans in attendance. The top three fanatics will take home pri
 zes and earn bragging rights as Windsong Ranch's ultimate football fans.\n
 Grab your friends\, wear your team colors\, and join us at THE BRIDGE for 
 a night of football\, food\, and fun as we cheer on one of the NFL's bigge
 st rivalries. We can't wait to kick off the season with you!\nRSVP : https
 ://secure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?filter=c2VhcmNoPTQ1MTg
 0MDM=
END:VEVENT
