DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a spooktacular night on Friday\, October 30 \, at
  THE BRIDGE! Gather your family and friends for an outdoor movie night fea
 turing Hocus Pocus 2 on the big screen under the stars. The fun begins at 
 7:00 PM with a special visit from the Sanderson Sisters! Meet Winifred\, M
 ary\, and Sarah\, snap some spooky photos\, and get into the Halloween spi
 rit before the movie begins at 7:30 PM .\nEnjoy free popcorn while you wat
 ch\, and grab something sweet from our dessert food trucks\, available for
  purchase throughout the evening. This is a ticketed event\, and a downloa
 dable ticket will be provided after checkout. Please bring your ticket—e
 ither on your mobile device or as a printed copy—as it will be scanned a
 t the door for entry. Bring your blankets\, lawn chairs\, and Halloween sp
 irit for a frightfully fun night!\nRSVP : https://secure.rec1.com/TX/winds
 ong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?filter=c2VhcmNoPTQ1Mzg2MjA=
