DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261111T120000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Join us at THE BRIDGE on Wednesday\, November 11\, from 10 AM t
 o 12 PM as we gather to honor and celebrate the brave men and women who ha
 ve served our country. Enjoy a morning of delicious brunch\, community\, a
 nd heartfelt appreciation as we recognize the sacrifices and service of ou
 r veterans.\nTo commemorate the day\, we invite residents to submit photos
  and names of veterans they would like to honor. We will create a special 
 slideshow featuring your submissions that will play during the event as we
  celebrate the heroes who have made a difference in our lives and our nati
 on. Please send all submissions to windsonglifestyle@ccmcnet.com .\nThis i
 s a ticket ed event\, and a downloadable ticket will be provided after che
 ckout. Please bring your ticket —either on your mobile device or as a pr
 inted copy—as it will be scanned at the door for entry. We look forward 
 to coming together as a community to honor those who have served!\nRSVP : 
 https://secure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?filter=c2VhcmNoPT
 Q1NTcxMjY=
