SUMMARY:Holiday DIY Doormat Workshop @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261120T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261120T200000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Give your front porch a personal touch and join us for a fun\, 
 hands-on evening of creativity at Porch Perfect: Holiday DIY Doormat Works
 hop with AR Workshop! The workshop will take place on Friday\, November 20
 \, beginning at 6:30 PM in THE BRIDGE\, where AR Workshop's talented instr
 uctors will provide step-by-step guidance as you create a custom doormat f
 or your home.\nParticipants will be able to choose from four unique design
  options and craft a one-of-a-kind piece that adds personality and charm t
 o their front entryway. The cost is $20 per doormat.\nPlease note that the
  password to access the registration website is DOORMAT. When purchasing y
 our ticket\, you must select your preferred design. Design selections cann
 ot be changed on the day of the event\, so please be sure to review your c
 hoice carefully before completing your registration.\nGather your friends\
 , get creative\, and leave with a custom doormat that's sure to welcome gu
 ests in style!\nRSVP : https://www.arworkshop.com/events/garland/549829/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:877b741b5f1f97c16c6e950bb1585edae66fc13a@windsong-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T172710Z
SUMMARY:Lunch & Learn @ THE BRIDGE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261118T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261118T133000
LOCATION:THE BRIDGE
CATEGORIES:Lifestyle Events
DESCRIPTION:Fall is in the air\, but taking a fall doesn't have to be! Join
  us on Wednesday\, November 18\, at 12 PM at THE BRIDGE for an informative
  Lunch & Learn focused on fall prevention and personal safety.\nDuring thi
 s interactive session\, you'll learn about common causes of falls\, practi
 cal ways to reduce risks at home and in everyday activities\, tips for imp
 roving balance and mobility\, and strategies to help maintain independence
  and confidence as you age.\nWhether you're looking to prevent future fall
 s\, support a loved one\, or simply learn how to stay safe and active\, th
 is presentation offers valuable information for everyone. Come enjoy lunch
 \, connect with neighbors\, and leave with simple tools to help you stay h
 ealthy\, confident\, and steady on your feet this fall!\nRSVP : https://se
 cure.rec1.com/TX/windsong-ranch-hoa-tx/catalog?filter=c2VhcmNoPTQ1NjgxMjM=
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
